{"answer_text":"A shared inbox is often enough for small support teams before a full help desk. The best-rated: [1]\n\n- **Brightdesk Helpdesk**: Strong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated. [2]\n- **Calmline**: The most pleasant shared inbox for small support teams; reporting is basic. [3]\n- **Northwind CRM Service Desk**: A full suite with a service desk included in the higher tiers. [4]\n\nIn short, Brightdesk is the strongest fit for most teams; Calmline is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50ed-72ed-a7c4-18b72bbfcefb","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:50.250Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["shared inbox collision detection","best shared inbox support team","shared inbox vs help desk"],"latency_ms":5580,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[105,115],[408,418]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[204,212]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[300,313]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."}],"model":"perplexi